        "original_id": "dac53ef6-eba5-525f-817a-c898e673ec41",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dean Jones, Gordon Gordon, Mildred Gordon, Robert Stevenson\n- Works: That Darn Cat!, Undercover Cat\n- Roles: Agent Zeke Kelso\n\nFacts:\n- Dean Jones was an American actor who was born on January 25, 1931, and died on September 1, 2015.\n- The 1963 novel Undercover Cat was written by Gordon Gordon and Mildred Gordon.\n- Dean Jones was best known for playing Agent Zeke Kelso in That Darn Cat!.\n- That Darn Cat! was based on the 1963 novel Undercover Cat.\n- Robert Stevenson directed That Darn Cat!.",
